    answer: "Our Business & Commercial Mediation helps resolve:\n\n• Contract disputes and breaches\n• Partnership/shareholder disagreements\n• Vendor and supplier conflicts\n• Franchise disputes\n• Business dissolution\n• Construction and project disputes\n• Family-owned business conflicts\n\nFast, confidential, and cost-effective — without going to court."
