    answer: "Our Workplace & Employment Mediation handles:\n\n• Employer–employee disputes\n• Harassment and discrimination claims\n• Wrongful termination conflicts\n• Workplace communication breakdowns\n• Team and departmental conflicts\n• Contract and employment issues\n\nWe protect both employee and company privacy."
  },
  {
    keys: ['court','legal','lawsuit','judge','litigation','pre-litigation','small claims','civil','attorney','law'],
    answer: "Our Court-Connected Mediation assists with:\n\n• Court-ordered mediation cases\n• Pre-litigation dispute resolution\n• Small claims mediation\n• Civil and business disputes\n• Contract and financial disagreements\n\nWe help you avoid trial — faster and more affordable."
  },
  {
    keys: ['real estate','property','landlord','tenant','hoa','boundary','construction','title','realtor','lease','land'],
    answer: "Our Real Estate & Property Mediation covers:\n\n• Landlord–tenant disputes\n• HOA and community conflicts\n• Property line and boundary disputes\n• Real estate transaction disagreements\n• Construction defects or delays\n• Title and ownership issues\n• Realtor-client disputes\n\nQuick, private, and legally binding resolutions."
  },
  {
    keys: ['personal injury','insurance','accident','auto','car','slip','fall','workers','compensation','liability','medical','malpractice'],
    answer: "Our Personal Injury & Insurance Mediation handles:\n\n• Auto accident claims\n• Slip and fall / premises liability\n• Workers' compensation disputes\n• Insurance policy disagreements\n• Liability and negligence claims\n• Medical-related disputes\n\nFair, fast settlements without court stress."
  },
  {
    keys: ['what is mediation','how does mediation work','explain mediation','define mediation','mediation mean'],
    answer: "Mediation is a confidential, voluntary process where a neutral third-party mediator helps disputing parties reach a mutually acceptable agreement — without going to court.\n\nTop Benefits:\n✓ Cost-effective (save on legal fees)\n✓ Faster resolution (days/weeks, not months)\n✓ Private and confidential\n✓ You control the outcome — not a judge\n✓ Less stressful and adversarial\n✓ Agreements are legally binding (MSA)"
  },
  {
    keys: ['msa','mediation settlement','agreement','binding','enforceable','legal agreement'],
    answer: "A Mediation Settlement Agreement (MSA) is a legally binding contract resulting from successful mediation.\n\n• Enforceable in court once signed\n• Clearly defines terms and obligations\n• Courts uphold valid MSAs\n• Can be court-approved for extra enforcement\n• Faster than traditional litigation\n\nYou get legal protection AND control over the outcome."
  },
  {
