    answer: "All Valor Mediation sessions are conducted 100% online via secure Zoom.\n\nBenefits:\n• Participate from anywhere in Texas or the U.S.\n• No travel required\n• Flexible scheduling (evenings & weekends available)\n• Fully secure and confidential\n• Faster scheduling and resolution\n\nJust a stable internet connection is all you need!"
  },
