    answer: "Getting started is easy!\n\n📅 Schedule your FREE consultation:\n📞 Call: 817-908-4070\n✉️ Email: rex@valormediation.com\n\nWe offer flexible morning, afternoon, evening, and weekend appointments to fit your schedule.\n\nAll consultations are confidential and conducted via Zoom."
