    answer: "Contact Valor Mediation, LLC:\n\n📞 Phone: 817-908-4070\n✉️ Email: rex@valormediation.com\n\nAll sessions are 100% online via Zoom — no travel needed.\n\nFree initial consultation available. We serve clients across Texas and nationwide."
  },
