    answer: "Mediation is significantly more affordable than litigation!\n\n• No expensive court costs\n• No lengthy attorney fees\n• Resolve disputes in days or weeks — not years\n• Free initial consultation available\n\nFor specific pricing information, please contact us:\n📞 817-908-4070\n✉️ rex@valormediation.com"
  },
  {
    keys: ['area','location','city','serve','texas','dallas','fort worth','houston','austin','san antonio','plano','arlington','irving','garland','frisco','denton','grand prairie','mckinney','nationwide','usa','united states'],
    answer: "We serve clients across Texas and nationwide!\n\nMajor Texas Cities:\nDallas • Fort Worth • Houston • Austin • San Antonio • Plano • Arlington • Irving • Garland • Frisco • McKinney • Denton • Grand Prairie • Waco • Lubbock\n\nBecause all sessions are online via Zoom, we serve clients anywhere in the United States — no travel required."
  },
  {
    keys: ['rex','steele','mediator','founder','about','who are you','who is','certified','veteran','navy'],
    answer: "Meet Rex Steele — Lead Mediator at Valor Mediation, LLC\n\n• Certified Professional Mediator\n• U.S. Navy Veteran\n• Business Strategist & Negotiation Expert\n• 13+ years directing a Small Business Development Center (SBDC)\n• Background in commercial real estate, business brokerage, and engineering management\n\nRex brings strength, integrity, and calm authority to every session."
  },
  {
    keys: ['why choose','why valor','benefit','advantage','reason','better than','vs court','versus','instead of court'],
    answer: "Why Choose Valor Mediation?\n\n✓ Focused exclusively on mediation (not a law firm)\n✓ Completely neutral and unbiased\n✓ Personalized approach for every dispute\n✓ Certified, experienced mediator\n✓ Flexible evening & weekend scheduling\n✓ 100% secure online via Zoom\n✓ Legally binding agreements (MSA)\n✓ Free initial consultation\n✓ Serving Texas & all of USA"
  },
  {
    keys: ['confidential','privacy','private','secret','secure','data'],
    answer: "Confidentiality is a cornerstone of our practice.\n\n• All sessions are completely private\n• No public records (unlike court proceedings)\n• Secure Zoom platform for all meetings\n• Strict ethical standards maintained\n• Your personal and business information stays protected at every stage\n\nYou can speak freely without fear of disclosure."
  },
  {
