    answer: "Mediation is significantly faster than litigation!\n\n• Many disputes resolved in 1–2 sessions\n• Typical resolution: days to weeks\n• Court cases can take months or years\n• Flexible scheduling speeds up the process\n\nThe exact duration depends on the complexity of your dispute. Contact us for an estimate:\n📞 817-908-4070"
  },
  {
    keys: ['thank','thanks','appreciate','helpful','great','awesome','good'],
    answer: "You're very welcome! It's our pleasure to assist you.\n\nIf you have more questions or are ready to move forward, we offer a free consultation:\n\n📞 Call: 817-908-4070\n✉️ Email: rex@valormediation.com\n\nValor Mediation — Resolving disputes with clarity, confidence, and compassion."
  },
  {
    keys: ['bye','goodbye','see you','later','take care'],
    answer: "Thank you for contacting Valor Mediation, LLC! \n\nWhenever you're ready to resolve your dispute, we're here to help.\n\n📞 817-908-4070\n✉️ rex@valormediation.com\n\nHave a wonderful day!"
